  "writing_rules": [
    "This owner tracks unnamed aggregate shinobi cohorts plus current career-administration truth; exact named shinobi remain outside aggregate promotion authority.",
    "Promotions move conserved bodies one rank step at a time and preserve fractional promotion credit between monthly reviews.",
    "Academy intake is deduplicated by graduation transfer identity before entering the aggregate Genin cohort.",
    "Promotion-exam cycle rows record institutional phase state only; they never establish a named candidate result or promotion.",
    "Promotion-exam registration rows record an authorized exact candidate entry into an active cycle only; registration_mode records whether the row came from ordinary institution autonomy or a guarded OOC DEV reconciliation and never changes the row's authority.",
    "Promotion-exam evaluation rows establish deterministic qualification or field-evaluation evidence only; evaluation_mode records ordinary institution autonomy versus guarded reconciliation and never supplies the outcome itself.",
    "Every row belonging to every still-active promotion-exam cycle must remain in this authoritative owner regardless of current cycle cardinality. Only non-active hot administrative history may be compacted, with durable historical provenance retained through semantic world-event archives.",
    "Promotion-exam bout rows preserve the public finals bracket, autonomous combat-kernel evidence, and winner/loser for tournament progression. A bout row never itself promotes a candidate and its exam-specific referee kernel does not directly create lasting injury.",
    "Exact rank accounting rows mirror a separately authorized exact-person career transition and must conserve the aggregate village rank total."
  ]
